   . About TeamHires

TeamHires is a web-based platform designed to connect teams with available projects and opportunities. It acts as a bridge between project providers and teams looking to apply, collaborate, and showcase their skills.

The main goal of TeamHires is to simplify the process of:

Creating team profiles

Posting and managing projects

Applying for projects

Tracking project progress

.Purpose of TeamHires

In traditional systems, managing team-based projects is often manual, unorganized, and time-consuming. TeamHires solves this problem by providing a centralized digital platform where:

Teams can easily register and manage their profiles

Project providers can post requirements

Teams can apply for suitable projects

All interactions are managed efficiently in one place

. Key Features

. Team Registration & Profile Management

. Project Posting System

. Apply for Projects Functionality

. Project Status Updates

. Secure Login System (JSP + Database)

.Technology Used

Frontend: HTML, CSS

Backend: JSP (Java Server Pages)

Database: MySQL

Server: Apache Tomcat

. Benefits

Saves time and reduces manual work

Improves communication between teams and clients

Organizes all project-related data in one system

Easy to use and scalable
